  "limitations": [
    "Cold recall means the first read series after closing and reopening redb; the harness does not evict operating-system page cache.",
    "This bounded native adapter measures exact persistent storage recall, not M9 hybrid ANN/model orchestration.",
    "RSS is sampled at phase boundaries and is not a continuous allocator or kernel peak trace.",
    "The portable backup scenario exercises the production journal backup/restore boundary; the primary synthetic scale dataset is verified independently by reopen and digest.",
    "BENCH-E coverage in this package is a logical fixture/evaluator and does not measure real media decoders or modality models.",
    "M17 release certification remains blocked until the M16 deep security scan passes.",
    "The 10000000-record scale dataset uses a streaming expected digest/count and 2000 deterministic point recalls; full clone-on-write MVCC differential coverage is separately executed on 4096 records.",
    "This run exercises 10000000 storage records only; the ERRATA E-009 10M semantic-node floor and required graph-edge/vector coverage remain unmeasured.",
    "The bounded MVCC expected/actual digest fields were reconstructed by rerunning only the deterministic 4096-record probe configuration; the 10M measured phases were not rerun.",
    "Evidence kind is not release_certification; the result must remain observation_only unless an exact correctness gate fails.",
    "Full BENCH-H coverage is incomplete: semantic_nodes=0, graph_edges=0, vectors=0; every required scenario and M17-E01/E02/E03 class must also pass.",
    "M16 deep security scan is not passed for this evidence; M17 release status remains open."
  ]
